WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.954
Long form is often the more flexible analytical
shape If categories

00:00:05.967 --> 00:00:11.696
change frequently new values simply appear in rows
Long form also

00:00:11.723 --> 00:00:18.262
works naturally with trend charts filtering grouping
and many modeling workflows It

00:00:18.288 --> 00:00:21.762
avoids changing the schema every time a new category
appears
